            @Oxpd.Touch Text (${Resolution})
            While:!Oxpd.Wait For Xpath (//li[contains\(@class\,"active-list"\)]/div[contains\(text\(\)\,"${Resolution}"\)],${Minimal_Wait_Time}):4
